# Club Championship Scoring - environment variables
#
# Copy to .env for local overrides (not committed). On Railway, set these in the
# service "Variables" tab instead of committing them.

# Port the server listens on. Railway injects PORT automatically, so you do NOT
# need to set this on Railway. Useful only for local production runs.
# PORT=3000

# Absolute path to the SQLite database file. On Railway, point this at a mounted
# volume so competition data survives redeploys and restarts (the container
# filesystem is otherwise ephemeral). Example if the volume is mounted at /data:
# DATABASE_FILE=/data/club-championship.db
